OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 26 MAY
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GSoweto Kinch welcomes composer
OL,6,     Gand saxophonist Cassie Kinoshi,
OL,7,     Gto reflect on three albums by
OL,8,     GMiles Davis that have influenced
OL,9,     Gher, on his birthday night.
OL,10,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,11,     GKristiina Poska conducts the
OL,12,     GNorwegian Radio Orchestra in
OL,13,     GSibelius' two last symphonies. In
OL,14,     Gbetween, Shostakovich's energetic
OL,15,     GConcerto for Piano and Trumpet.
